{"skill":{"slug":"notion-pages","displayName":"Notion"},"version":{"version":"0.1.1","createdAt":1780841172441,"changelog":"Add/fix Setup in 3 Steps GIF table so connection GIFs render correctly.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":11337,"sha256":"8888e745ddec33eff9547f9ba392b39f9140431965cc2ff607e4e8e76194c44a","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2346,"sha256":"d0768c118e4335483914f7e6d9c54ab683c5fdaed1d0f583ce4652e0693dc59f","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789545001788,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"fae87a91d2fcd52413f50faf8bc8af074b473c59e8f6f5a6fa439ec92ac84598","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/fae87a91d2fcd52413f50faf8bc8af074b473c59e8f6f5a6fa439ec92ac84598","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780841206776},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"SAFE","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789545001788},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"medium","summary":"This skill transparently sets up a Notion integration through ClawLink, with notable but disclosed risks from installing and enabling an external OAuth-backed plugin.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Using OAuth and a hosted connector is proportionate for Notion API access, but it gives ClawLink authenticated access to the Notion resources granted by the user.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Setup installs `clawhub:clawlink-plugin`, allowlists it, and restarts the OpenClaw gateway after user confirmation; this is disclosed and purpose-aligned, but the plugin is referenced by a mutable package name rather than a pinned version or digest.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill directs discovery through ClawLink's live Notion tool catalog, requires preview and explicit confirmation for writes, and does not contain prompt hijacking, hidden override, or deceptive instructions.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The plugin allowlist and gateway restart make the integration available in later chats; this persistence is disclosed as part of setup and troubleshooting, with no bundled service, hook, or hidden background worker in the skill artifact.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is Notion search, read, create, update, and workflow management, and the documented capabilities match that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you trust ClawLink and are comfortable granting it Notion OAuth access. Review the Notion permissions during authorization, share only the pages or databases needed, and expect the plugin to remain enabled for future OpenClaw chats until you remove or disable it.","findings":"[T08] expected: The unpinned ClawLink plugin install is a real supply-chain consideration because the audited artifact does not include the plugin implementation, but the installation, allowlisting, OAuth use, and Notion purpose are plainly documented and require user setup rather than hidden execution.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789545001788}}}}}